  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "note_kinds",
      "text": "Four kinds, one canvas:\n\nfk — a real constraint, in the script.\nembed — rows serialized into a column.\nflow — rows computed from other rows.\ndependency — something reads it; nothing enforces it.\n\nOnly fk reaches the CREATE TABLE script. The other three are for the humans.",
